DTSTAMP:20261112T145448Z
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270210
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270211
SUMMARY:Deadline: SPACES: Echo Artist Residency (Cleveland\, paired residen
 cy with honorarium and production budget)
DESCRIPTION:Echo is a paired residency at SPACES in Cleveland: each season 
 it selects one Northeast Ohio artist (Cuyahoga and contiguous counties) an
 d one artist from outside the region as a peer cohort\, preferring complem
 entary or intersecting themes\, though collaboration is not required.\n\nO
 rganisation: SPACES\nLocation: Cleveland\, Ohio\, USA. In person. One arti
 st from Northeast Ohio and one from outside the region are selected each s
 eason.\nAward: Artist honorarium and production budget plus lodging in the
  gallery. SPACES does not publish figures\; the Alliance of Artists Commun
 ities listing gives a USD 2\,000 artist stipend plus USD 500 for travel an
 d materials. No application fee.\nDuration: 4 to 6 week residency\, follow
 ed by a public exhibition of about 6 weeks\n\nMore: https://www.spacescle.
 org/for-artists/echo-artist-residency-program?utm_source=artificialnouveau
 grantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.spacescle.org/for-artists/echo-artist-residency-program?utm
 _source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Cleveland\, Ohio\, USA. In person. One artist from Northeast Ohio 
 and one from outside the region are selected each season.
END:VEVENT
